00:17:52,250 --> 00:17:53,050
These 10 pills...

281
00:17:53,350 --> 00:17:55,080
You've been shouting about them for a month now.

282
00:17:55,220 --> 00:17:56,560
And no one will recognize their quality.

283
00:17:56,590 --> 00:17:57,920
This is pretty good stuff you know ?

284
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:01,240
Brother Li,

285
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:03,240
I haven't seen this fellow cultivator before.

286
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:03,880
First time ?

287
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,600
This is my friend,

288
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:06,240
Xu Mu.

289
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:07,720
He's here to look around.

290
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:10,320
So it's Brother Xu.

291
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:13,200
Here are some Turtle Breath Pills.

292
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:15,520
With these,

293
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:18,040
even Peak Late stage Soul Transformation cultivators aren't scary.

294
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:30,400
Not here either.

295
00:18:36,120 --> 00:18:37,200
Wang Lin,

296
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:40,640
let's see how long you can hide !

297
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,200
What's this ?

298
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:54,880
Nirvana Cleanser blood-colored killing intent ?

299
00:18:54,960 --> 00:18:55,320
Go !

300
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:56,160
This place

301
00:18:57,680 --> 00:18:58,920
returns to ruins.

302
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:16,920
Kneel.

303
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,760
Xixue's aura !

304
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:25,480
I finally found you.

305
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:27,760
Hand over Xixue !

306
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:39,880
Fall !

307
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:56,160
Li Yuan !

308
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:03,960
Annihilation Restriction Heart !

309
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:11,560
To the teleportation formation !

310
00:20:11,560 --> 00:20:12,080
Quick !

311
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:14,080
Teleportation formation !

312
00:20:14,320 --> 00:20:14,640
Hurry !

313
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:15,080
Hurry up !

314
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:15,480
Go !

315
00:20:24,800 --> 00:20:25,600
Hurry up !

316
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:28,880
Futile resistance.

317
00:20:32,760 --> 00:20:33,560
Xu Liguo !

318
00:20:34,040 --> 00:20:34,400
Hey !

319
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:36,120
Don't get too cocky, you old demon !

320
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:37,560
Xu Liguo

321
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:38,160
Grandpa Xu will fight you !

322
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:41,680
I can't win...

323
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:43,560
Grandpa Xu will go ahead first !

324
00:20:45,120 --> 00:20:46,480
Wait for me !

325
00:20:55,280 --> 00:20:56,000
Go !

326
00:21:03,560 --> 00:21:05,040
He's gone...

327
00:21:07,280 --> 00:21:08,720
Killing you is easy.

328
00:21:09,280 --> 00:21:10,600
I'll let you live

329
00:21:11,280 --> 00:21:13,960
while I search for Xixue's soul.

330
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:18,400
Try to run away ?

331
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:20,960
No one here

332
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:23,040
can escape my grasp !

333
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:47,600
I can smell it.

334
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:50,800
This is the scent of Father's blood spells.

335
00:21:51,560 --> 00:21:52,480
Wang Lin,

336
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:55,040
I can also sense your fear.

337
00:21:56,280 --> 00:21:56,960
What ?

338
00:21:57,760 --> 00:21:59,240
Will you wag your tail

339
00:21:59,320 --> 00:22:00,440
and let me go ?

340
00:22:01,320 --> 00:22:02,680
Or do you want to kneel

341
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:05,200
and beg me to put in a good word with Father

342
00:22:05,520 --> 00:22:06,960
to spare your pathetic life !?

343
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:08,800
You can dream !

344
00:22:09,320 --> 00:22:11,600
I can convince Father to let you live a little more,

345
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:13,080
to suffer day by day,

346
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:14,280
unable to die !

347
00:22:14,640 --> 00:22:15,320
It seems

348
00:22:15,760 --> 00:22:16,640
no matter what,

349
00:22:17,080 --> 00:22:19,200
my fate will be the same.

350
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:21,680
I'm glad you understand.

351
00:22:22,280 --> 00:22:24,480
Killing me is the same as releasing me.

352
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:26,640
And if you seal me somewhere,

353
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:29,680
you'll face my father's endless pursuit !

354
00:22:30,440 --> 00:22:31,760
One day,

355
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:34,000
