356
00:22:34,520 --> 00:22:36,200
I'll get out of here !

357
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:39,040
There is no way out.

358
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:42,040
Only one of us can live.

359
00:22:57,120 --> 00:22:58,560
Are you looking for this ?

360
00:23:01,240 --> 00:23:02,800
The situation was critical earlier

361
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:04,200
so I retrieved it for you.

362
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:10,680
However precious a restriction may be,

363
00:23:10,760 --> 00:23:12,280
it can't compare to a mother's love.

364
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:15,680
Li Yuan thanks Brother Xu

365
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:17,520
for retrieving this charm of mine.

366
00:23:19,560 --> 00:23:20,600
No need for thanks.

367
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:23,080
I risked my life !

368
00:23:23,280 --> 00:23:24,840
You should be thanking me !

369
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:28,080
Brother Xu,

370
00:23:29,160 --> 00:23:30,160
