371
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:31,520
The Yao Family of Allheaven

372
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:33,160
is very powerful

373
00:23:33,520 --> 00:23:34,640
and rules with an iron fist.

374
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:37,760
Those who defy it have to pay with their blood.

375
00:23:38,760 --> 00:23:41,480
This is a common consensus throughout the Allheaven Star System.

376
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:42,720
Those who offend them

377
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:44,920
are either kept alive as Blood Slaves

378
00:23:45,080 --> 00:23:46,800
or become pools of blood.

379
00:23:47,800 --> 00:23:49,080
There are no exceptions.

380
00:23:49,920 --> 00:23:51,840
That man's cultivation is Nirvana Cleanser.

381
00:23:52,040 --> 00:23:53,560
Just now, I unleashed my Restriction Heart at full power

382
00:23:53,560 --> 00:23:55,280
with 4 layers of Annihilation Restrictions,

383
00:23:55,520 --> 00:23:58,000
but holding him back even for an instant was so difficult.

384
00:23:58,400 --> 00:23:59,600
On the cultivation path,

385
00:24:00,240 --> 00:24:02,560
the difference of a single realm is an uncrossable bridge,

386
00:24:02,840 --> 00:24:04,400
let alone multiple realms at a time.

387
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:05,440
Brother Xu,

388
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:06,320
you...

389
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:12,960
It's a life or death situation now.

390
00:24:13,800 --> 00:24:14,360
Brother Xu,

391
00:24:14,760 --> 00:24:15,560
if you trust me,

392
00:24:16,040 --> 00:24:18,120
I will use all the restrictions I've studied in my life

393
00:24:18,360 --> 00:24:20,200
to give you a sliver of a chance of escaping.

394
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:26,080
It seems

395
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:29,280
I'm being targeted by such a powerhouse...

396
00:24:30,600 --> 00:24:32,600
Is running my only way out ?

397
00:24:46,560 --> 00:24:47,000
This...

398
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:48,840
Where are we ?

399
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:52,960
Weren't we supposed to be on a fragment of the Thunder Celestial Realm ?

400
00:24:53,720 --> 00:24:56,640
Giant trees and plants still lush without roots...

401
00:24:57,520 --> 00:24:58,640
Frozen butterflies...

402
00:25:04,840 --> 00:25:05,720
This place

403
00:25:06,520 --> 00:25:08,040
is a harmonious whole.

404
00:25:18,200 --> 00:25:20,800
I had finally found a quiet place to sleep...

405
00:25:21,040 --> 00:25:24,200
Master Flamespark
Peak Nirvana Shatterer

406
00:25:21,360 --> 00:25:23,080
So noisy...

407
00:25:23,760 --> 00:25:25,200
they disturbed my sleep.

408
00:25:25,280 --> 00:25:26,000
Brother Xu,

409
00:25:26,560 --> 00:25:27,720
when we teleported,

410
00:25:28,200 --> 00:25:30,600
the Thunder Escaping Market's teleportation formation nearly collapsed

411
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:33,360
and clashed with the spatial energy of my Li family's Annihilation Restriction.

412
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:34,840
That's why

413
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:36,240
we were thrown into this place.

414
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:41,920
These two little guys

415
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:43,880
are somewhat interesting.

416
00:25:44,760 --> 00:25:46,160
One

417
00:25:47,640 --> 00:25:49,080
smells like restrictions,

418
00:25:49,760 --> 00:25:51,840
he has a great inheritance !

419
00:25:53,040 --> 00:25:53,840
Boring.

420
00:25:55,040 --> 00:25:56,440
The other one

421
00:25:58,960 --> 00:26:02,080
has an uncomfortable bloody smell on him.

422
00:26:02,160 --> 00:26:04,600
He's targeted by those bloodsuckers of the Yao Family.

423
00:26:06,280 --> 00:26:07,600
Such bad luck...

424
00:26:13,080 --> 00:26:15,040
He's actually quite perceptive.

425
00:26:15,760 --> 00:26:18,360
He's far better than those idiots in the Temple.

426
00:26:20,760 --> 00:26:22,920
Since you've landed in my hands,

427
00:26:23,200 --> 00:26:24,680
no matter how you are,

428
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:27,360
I will shape you by my rules.

429
00:26:30,880 --> 00:26:32,840
Especially you, kid.

430
00:26:33,040 --> 00:26:34,640
You even have a hint of thunder.

431
00:26:35,120 --> 00:26:37,080
Don't let Grandpa

432
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:38,800
be too disappointed.

433
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:43,040
A self-contained world

434
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:46,520
but not like a Celestial's cave.

435
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:48,480
This place...

436
00:26:49,320 --> 00:26:50,600
what is it ?

437
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:07,920
Excellent... excellent !

438
00:27:10,360 --> 00:27:11,160
Run around,

439
00:27:11,160 --> 00:27:12,160
jump around,

440
00:27:12,360 --> 00:27:15,280
let me see how long you can hop around.

441
00:27:17,320 --> 00:27:18,680
A Nirvana Shatterer old monster !

442
00:27:21,520 --> 00:27:22,520
If you're too slow,

443
00:27:22,840 --> 00:27:24,400
you will die.

444
00:27:25,960 --> 00:27:27,560
I have no grudge with this person.

445
00:27:28,120 --> 00:27:28,720
Why ?

446
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:34,120
Wonderful, wonderful !

447
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:36,080
That sudden movement

448
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:38,520
was executed with perfect precision.

449
00:27:39,600 --> 00:27:40,320
Unfortunately,

450
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:41,680
you're too slow

451
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:42,760
and too conventional !

452
00:27:43,080 --> 00:27:44,640
Grandpa isn't entertained !

453
00:27:48,120 --> 00:27:48,920
Pure Yang Thunder ?

454
00:27:49,520 --> 00:27:50,320
Cold Ice Thunder ?

455
00:27:50,840 --> 00:27:51,680
Spatial Dark Thunder !

456
00:27:52,360 --> 00:27:54,160
His thunder spells have reached perfection.

457
00:27:54,320 --> 00:27:56,520
This person must be deeply connected to the Thunder Celestial Temple.

458
00:27:58,120 --> 00:27:59,080
If he wanted to kill me,

459
00:27:59,080 --> 00:27:59,880
it would be easy.

460
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:02,160
Why does he go to such lengths ?

461
00:28:02,560 --> 00:28:03,360
It's as if

462
00:28:04,560 --> 00:28:05,600
he were toying with me.

463
00:28:08,600 --> 00:28:10,520
I can't let him lead me around any longer !

464
00:28:11,080 --> 00:28:12,240
Since you use thunder,

465
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:14,720
I'll break it with thunder !

466
00:28:20,680 --> 00:28:21,320
Senior,

467
00:28:21,560 --> 00:28:22,840
you wouldn't go to such lengths

468
00:28:23,360 --> 00:28:24,640
if you just wanted to kill me.

469
00:28:24,920 --> 00:28:26,120
Why are you bothering with all this ?

470
00:28:27,040 --> 00:28:28,440
If you're toying with me like this,

471
00:28:28,800 --> 00:28:31,360
maybe you've taken a fancy for my meager skills ?

472
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:33,080
Are you

473
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:35,320
trying to test my limits ?

474
00:28:46,680 --> 00:28:47,960
You're a good kid.

475
00:28:48,360 --> 00:28:50,480
Grandpa was just bored

476
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:52,800
and just wanted to see what you're made of.

477
00:28:54,520 --> 00:28:55,480
As expected,

478
00:28:55,680 --> 00:28:59,440
a little guy that those bloodsuckers of the Yao Family covet

479
00:29:00,120 --> 00:29:04,120
has some death-defying toughness in his bones.

480
00:29:05,160 --> 00:29:06,160
You have guts.

481
00:29:06,280 --> 00:29:07,520
You have quick wits.

482
00:29:08,920 --> 00:29:11,200
The more I look at you,

483
00:29:12,720 --> 00:29:15,040
the more I feel you are fated with me.

484
00:29:19,280 --> 00:29:21,960
Suitable souls are hard to find

485
00:29:22,360 --> 00:29:25,320
yet I happened to encounter such a fated beast.

486
00:29:30,960 --> 00:29:32,480
Little guy,

487
00:29:32,520 --> 00:29:33,080
not bad.

488
00:29:33,160 --> 00:29:34,360
But it's mine now.

489
00:29:35,040 --> 00:29:35,680
Senior !

490
00:29:36,080 --> 00:29:37,260
What's the rush ?

491
00:29:37,320 --> 00:29:39,520
I always act fairly.

492
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:41,720
I dislike being in debt for no reason

493
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:43,840
and I dislike being owed.

494
00:29:44,560 --> 00:29:46,480
Since I've taken your Thunder Beast,

495
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:49,920
I've already given you a gift.

496
00:29:50,600 --> 00:29:52,280
Take your time to enlighten yourself.

497
00:29:55,880 --> 00:29:56,880
That old monster...

498
00:29:57,800 --> 00:29:59,200
has already given me a gift ?

499
00:30:00,400 --> 00:30:01,440
What did he give me ?

500
00:30:02,560 --> 00:30:03,400
Rootless trees...

501
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:04,920
Sourceless water...

502
00:30:05,800 --> 00:30:06,920
A self-contained world...

503
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,720
Unique laws...

504
00:30:09,760 --> 00:30:11,280
This place isn't natural

505
00:30:11,880 --> 00:30:14,320
but the inside of a masterless bag of holding.

506
00:30:14,760 --> 00:30:17,400
I've already given you a gift.

507
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:20,960
So that's how it is !

508
00:30:22,240 --> 00:30:22,720
Brother Li,

509
00:30:23,200 --> 00:30:23,560
wake up.

510
00:30:24,360 --> 00:30:25,720
I know where we are.

511
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:29,560
That's right...

512
00:30:30,320 --> 00:30:30,800
That's right !

513
00:30:31,520 --> 00:30:33,080
It contains the heavens and the earth,

514
00:30:33,120 --> 00:30:34,160
everything is frozen,

515
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:36,640
rootless trees

516
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:38,080
and sourceless water.

517
00:30:39,360 --> 00:30:40,320
There's no mistake !

518
00:30:40,440 --> 00:30:40,920
Brother Xu,

519
00:30:41,320 --> 00:30:43,640
This must be the place mentioned in ancient records whose inheritance was cut off.

520
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:45,720
Celestial's bag of holding

521
00:30:43,640 --> 00:30:44,720
It's a Celestial's bag of holding !

522
00:30:46,720 --> 00:30:47,560
I understand now.

523
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:49,480
The key to leaving is

524
00:30:49,520 --> 00:30:50,560
a reverse restriction !

525
00:30:51,320 --> 00:30:53,200
Since this place defies common sense,

526
00:30:53,560 --> 00:30:54,760
we must take the opposite approach.

527
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:57,880
Just like our bags of holding,

528
00:30:57,920 --> 00:30:59,840
once a living being is captured inside,

529
00:30:59,880 --> 00:31:01,560
it can't leave from within.

530
00:31:02,320 --> 00:31:04,120
Only by opening the bag from the outside

531
00:31:04,480 --> 00:31:05,440
can we exit it.

532
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:08,040
Right now, we are inside the bag.

533
00:31:08,080 --> 00:31:09,960
We only need to use a reverse restriction

534
00:31:10,040 --> 00:31:11,880
to turn inner energy into outer energy.

535
00:31:12,320 --> 00:31:13,680
That way, the bag will open !

536
00:31:14,800 --> 00:31:17,000
It's said this bag isolates inside from outside.

537
00:31:17,720 --> 00:31:18,840
Once its master dies,

538
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:20,600
it's forever cut off from the outside.

539
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:23,440
Thanks to the passage of time,

540
00:31:23,960 --> 00:31:24,960
this entrance became unstable

541
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:25,840
and a crack formed.

542
00:31:26,720 --> 00:31:28,560
All my life, I've waited for an opportunity like this

543
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:29,840
to enter and have a look inside !

544
00:31:30,960 --> 00:31:31,520
Brother Li,

545
00:31:32,320 --> 00:31:33,200
you said that

546
00:31:33,360 --> 00:31:35,200
this item isolates the inside from the outside.

547
00:31:35,600 --> 00:31:37,000
Then no matter one's cultivation,

548
00:31:37,800 --> 00:31:39,360
it's absolutely impossible to enter or exit.

549
00:31:39,840 --> 00:31:40,920
Am I correct ?

550
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:42,520
The records say that

551
00:31:43,080 --> 00:31:44,080
for a self-contained world

552
00:31:44,160 --> 00:31:45,000
with complete laws,

553
00:31:45,520 --> 00:31:46,320
that's indeed the case.

554
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:48,120
Brother Li,

555
00:31:48,840 --> 00:31:51,520
If this place can't be entered or exited without the proper method,

556
00:31:52,480 --> 00:31:54,040
then if this world were to collapse,

557
00:31:54,200 --> 00:31:55,160
wouldn't everything within

558
00:31:55,800 --> 00:31:57,880
shatter with it ?

559
00:31:59,520 --> 00:31:59,920
You...

560
00:32:00,640 --> 00:32:01,960
Don't tell me you're thinking of...

561
00:32:02,120 --> 00:32:02,680
That's right.

562
00:32:03,760 --> 00:32:06,000
I want to use this place to kill the Blood Ancestor.

563
00:32:06,640 --> 00:32:07,640
What do you think ?

564
00:32:10,320 --> 00:32:11,440
Slaying an Immortal...

565
00:32:12,040 --> 00:32:12,800
Brother Xu,

566
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:14,320
are you aware of what you're saying ?

