The fragment of the Thunder Celestial Realm Wang Lin was on when he faced his tribulation was refined into a stamp artifact.
The whole structure of the Thunder Celestial Realm's story arc was rewritten to fit all these events in a single movie.

1393
01:28:43,360 --> 01:28:46,160
Even a mortal can slay an Immortal.

1394
01:28:46,680 --> 01:28:49,160
Even if a thousand dangers lie ahead,

1395
01:28:49,320 --> 01:28:52,000
no matter how high the mountain, I'll climb it.

1396
01:28:52,360 --> 01:28:53,680
My fate is mine alone,

1397
01:28:54,040 --> 01:28:55,120
I'm not afraid.

1398
01:28:55,680 --> 01:28:58,040
If the ocean trench is like a rift in the sky,

1399
01:28:58,600 --> 01:29:00,960
I'll become a mountain to tread the cloudy summit.

1400
01:29:01,320 --> 01:29:05,600
Rain like crimson ink, sword like a brush, I continue to write

1401
01:29:06,080 --> 01:29:09,920
the reincarnation cycle.

1402
01:29:13,400 --> 01:29:14,840
The wild grass buried the shore of the past.

1403
01:29:14,920 --> 01:29:16,560
The cold night never had lamplight for company.

1404
01:29:16,640 --> 01:29:17,720
Fate is carved into bone-chilling cold.

1405
01:29:17,720 --> 01:29:18,640
I only accept suffering,

1406
01:29:18,640 --> 01:29:19,480
not willing to lament.

1407
01:29:19,560 --> 01:29:21,000
Being born with nothing isn't tragic.

1408
01:29:21,000 --> 01:29:22,600
Tragedy is willingly bowing and accepting decay.

1409
01:29:22,600 --> 01:29:24,040
How many shackles are inscribed with fate's lament ?

1410
01:29:24,080 --> 01:29:25,640
I refuse to believe blood defines your rank.

1411
01:29:25,640 --> 01:29:28,240
Isn't the so-called fate meant to be rewritten ?

1412
01:29:28,480 --> 01:29:31,240
In a desperate situation, there is no path of retreat.

1413
01:29:31,440 --> 01:29:33,760
I will break the chains of reincarnation by my own hands.

1414
01:29:33,760 --> 01:29:37,200
No need to profile me, no compromise, no kneeling to the heavens.

1415
01:29:38,400 --> 01:29:40,080
Wind and rain rage on,

1416
01:29:40,840 --> 01:29:42,360
I hear the thunder rumbling.

1417
01:29:43,800 --> 01:29:45,200
Every scar

1418
01:29:46,440 --> 01:29:48,080
turns into a burden I bear.

1419
01:29:49,560 --> 01:29:51,360
No need for anyone to bestow me

1420
01:29:52,800 --> 01:29:54,040
with a talented body.

1421
01:29:55,800 --> 01:29:57,360
Emerging from the depths,

1422
01:29:58,120 --> 01:30:00,040
I possess my own vastness.

1423
01:30:01,350 --> 01:30:04,200
Even a mortal can slay an Immortal.

1424
01:30:04,720 --> 01:30:07,160
Even if a thousand dangers lie ahead,

1425
01:30:07,360 --> 01:30:10,040
no matter how high the mountain, I'll climb it.

1426
01:30:10,280 --> 01:30:11,720
My fate is mine alone,

1427
01:30:12,080 --> 01:30:13,160
I'm not afraid.

1428
01:30:13,600 --> 01:30:16,080
If the ocean trench is like a rift in the sky,

1429
01:30:16,560 --> 01:30:19,000
I'll become a mountain to tread the cloudy summit.

1430
01:30:19,400 --> 01:30:23,720
Rain like crimson ink, sword like a brush, I continue to write

1431
01:30:24,160 --> 01:30:27,440
the reincarnation cycle.

1432
01:30:25,400 --> 01:30:27,440
Fate's shackles imprison people, with no one to confide in to see through life and death.

1433
01:30:27,440 --> 01:30:28,320
Reincarnation was reshaped by me !

1434
01:30:28,320 --> 01:30:30,480
A thousand trials can't bind my pride, old chapters were turned.

1435
01:30:30,680 --> 01:30:31,400
One sword breaks the thick fog,

1436
01:30:31,480 --> 01:30:33,920
Righteous path or demonic, mortals are only fit to bow.

1437
01:30:33,920 --> 01:30:35,360
The chains that bind me don't mean I've surrendered.

1438
01:30:35,440 --> 01:30:37,000
Once the mind's steadied, the shackles are dismantled.

1439
01:30:37,440 --> 01:30:38,560
In the wilderness, walking alone.

1440
01:30:38,560 --> 01:30:39,040
Hardships !

1441
01:30:39,120 --> 01:30:40,000
Some loneliness is destined.

1442
01:30:40,040 --> 01:30:40,520
A thousand years !

1443
01:30:40,640 --> 01:30:41,240
When I scatter and

1444
01:30:41,520 --> 01:30:42,000
spread !

1445
01:30:42,160 --> 01:30:43,360
My fate is destined to be the summit.

1446
01:30:43,600 --> 01:30:45,000
Let me break all prejudices,

1447
01:30:45,080 --> 01:30:46,640
shatter the suspense of the unknown,

1448
01:30:46,640 --> 01:30:48,040
embrace the tempering of fire and frost.

1449
01:30:48,080 --> 01:30:49,560
Those who once looked down will look up at my transformation.

1450
01:30:49,000 --> 01:30:50,760
If I have no mountain to lean on,

1451
01:30:52,040 --> 01:30:53,600
I will become the mountain.

1452
01:30:55,040 --> 01:30:56,720
If I have no one to depend on,

1453
01:30:56,920 --> 01:30:59,200
I will become the heavens.

1454
01:30:59,440 --> 01:31:04,000
I shall ultimately stand as a lone wolf.

1455
01:31:25,600 --> 01:31:26,720
Wang Lin !
